{"id":"criminal","lemma":"criminal","pos":"adj","rank":1321,"glosses":["criminal"],"ipa":"/kɾimiˈnal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"criminales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-criminal.wav","examples":[{"text":"El criminal dejó huellas.","en":"The criminal left footprints.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735541"},{"text":"Creo que todos ellos son criminales.","en":"I think they're all criminals.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/915814"},{"text":"Por lo que sé es un criminal.","en":"For all I know, he's a criminal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645653"},{"text":"Muchos criminales en América son adictos a las drogas.","en":"Many criminals in America are addicted to drugs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606472"},{"text":"El criminal está nervioso.","en":"The criminal is nervous."}]}